--
Was KNOWNBUG with the headers of libstdc++ 16 (gcc 16) only: _Hashtable::find's
`__location_type (__trans_tmp_3);' (a parenthesised declarator of a nested
class declared later, [stmt.ambig]) and `const_iterator(__loc)' through
`explicit operator const_iterator()' ([over.match.copy]/1.2) dropped find(),
and count() read nondet.  Fixed in round 161.  Runs where the host gcc is >=
16 (tag libstdcxx16).
